Graphs -- graphs and digraphs
*****************************

Description
===========

This package defines classes for graphs and digraphs and related methods.

Contributors
============

Carlos Amendola, Alex Diaz, Luis David Garcia Puente, Roser Homs Pons, Olga
Kuznetsova, Shaowei Lin, Sonja Mapes, Harshit J Motwani, Mike Stillman, and
Doug Torrance contributed to this package.



