  * Outputs:
      * H, a *note graph: Graph,, This is the graph with the additional
        vertices specified in L

Description
===========

This method will add vertices (as singletons) to any already present graph.
Note that if you add a vertex that is already in the vertex set of the input
graph, that vertex will be ignored.

+--------------------------------+
|i1 : G = completeGraph 4        |
