degreeIn -- returns the "in-degree" of a vertex in a digraph
************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        x = degreeIn (D, v)
  * Inputs:
      * D, a *note digraph: Digraph,, 
      * v, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, a vertex of D
  * Outputs:
      * x, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 

