distanceMatrix -- Computes the distance matrix of a digraph
***********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        M = distanceMatrix(G)
  * Inputs:
      * G, a *note digraph: Digraph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * M, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)Matrix,, the distance matrix of G

Description
===========

The distance matrix is the matrix where entry M_(i,j) corresponds to the
distance between vertex indexed i and vertex indexed j in the specified graph.
If the distance between two vertexSet is infinite (i.e. the vertexSet are not
connected) the matrix lists the distance as -1.

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = graph({{1,2},{2,3},{3,4}},EntryMode=>"edges");      |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : d = distanceMatrix G                                    |
|                                                             |
|o2 = | 0 1 2 3 |                                             |
|     | 1 0 1 2 |                                             |
|     | 2 1 0 1 |                                             |
|     | 3 2 1 0 |                                             |
|                                                             |
|              4       4                                      |
|o2 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : G = digraph({1,2,3,4},{{2,3},{3,4}},EntryMode=>"edges");|
+-------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : d = distanceMatrix G                                    |
|                                                             |
|o4 = | 0  -1 -1 -1 |                                         |
|     | -1 0  1  2  |                                         |
|     | -1 -1 0  1  |                                         |
|     | -1 -1 -1 0  |                                         |
|                                                             |
|              4       4                                      |
|o4 : Matrix ZZ  <-- ZZ                                       |
+-------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note diameter(Graph): diameter_lpGraph_rp, -- Computes the diameter of a
    graph
