inducedSubgraph -- A method for finding the induced subgraph of any Graph or Digraph
************************************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        H = inducedSubgraph(G, L)
        D' = inducedSubgraph(D, L)
  * Inputs:
      * G, a *note graph: Graph,, 
      * D, a *note digraph: Digraph,, 
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, This list should contain vertices
        of G
  * Outputs:
      * H, a *note graph: Graph,, 
      * D', a *note digraph: Digraph,, The subgraph induced by removing the
        vertices in L

Description
===========

This method takes a graph or digraph and a list as the inputs. The List should
be the vertices of the subgraph the user wants to consider, and the output will
contain just those vertices and any edges from G that connect them.  This
method also is a way of iterating deleteVertex several times in a quick way.

+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = completeGraph 5                                              |
|                                                                      |
|o1 = Graph{0 => {1, 2, 3, 4}}                                         |
|           1 => {0, 2, 3, 4}                                          |
|           2 => {0, 1, 3, 4}                                          |
|           3 => {0, 1, 2, 4}                                          |
|           4 => {0, 1, 2, 3}                                          |
|                                                                      |
|o1 : Graph                                                            |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = {3,4}                                                        |
|                                                                      |
|o2 = {3, 4}                                                           |
|                                                                      |
|o2 : List                                                             |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : inducedSubgraph(G,S)                                             |
|                                                                      |
|o3 = Graph{3 => {4}}                                                  |
|           4 => {3}                                                   |
|                                                                      |
|o3 : Graph                                                            |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : D = digraph ({{1,2},{2,3},{3,4},{4,1},{2,4}},EntryMode=>"edges");|
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : D' = inducedSubgraph(D,{1,2,4})                                  |
|                                                                      |
|o5 = Digraph{1 => {2}}                                                |
|             2 => {4}                                                 |
|             4 => {1}                                                 |
|                                                                      |
|o5 : Digraph                                                          |
+----------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
