neighbors -- returns the neighbors of a vertex in a graph
*********************************************************

  * Usage: 
        N = neighbors(G,v)
  * Inputs:
      * G, a *note graph: Graph,, 
      * v, a *note thing: (Macaulay2Doc)Thing,, 
  * Outputs:
      * N, a *note set: (Macaulay2Doc)Set,, the neighbors of vertex v in graph
        G

Description
===========

The neighbors of a vertex v are all the vertexSet of G adjacent to v. That is,
if u is a neighbor to v, {v,u} is an edge of G.

