vertexCoverNumber -- returns the vertex cover number of a graph
***************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        v = vertexCoverNumber G
  * Inputs:
      * G, a *note graph: Graph,, 
  * Outputs:
      * v, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, the vertex cover number of
        graph G

Description
===========

The vertex cover number is the minimum length of the set of vertex covers of a
graph.

+-------------------------------------------------------------+
