wheelGraph -- Constructs a wheel graph
**************************************

  * Usage: 
        G = wheelGraph n
  * Inputs:
      * n, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * G, a *note graph: Graph,, The wheel graph with n vertices

Description
===========

A wheel graph is a cycle graph on n-1 vertices with an extra single vertex
adjacent to every vertex in the cycle.

+--------------------------------+
|i1 : G = wheelGraph 6           |
|                                |
|o1 = Graph{0 => {1, 2, 3, 4, 5}}|
|           1 => {0, 2, 5}       |
|           2 => {0, 1, 3}       |
|           3 => {0, 2, 4}       |
|           4 => {0, 3, 5}       |
|           5 => {0, 1, 4}       |
|                                |
|o1 : Graph                      |
+--------------------------------+

See also
