windmillGraph -- Constructs a windmill graph
********************************************

  * Usage: 
        G = windmillGraph(k,d)
  * Inputs:
      * k, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
      * d, an *note integer: (Macaulay2Doc)ZZ,, 
  * Outputs:
      * G, a *note graph: Graph,, The windmill graph constructed by joining d
        copies of the complete graph K_k at a shared vertex.

Description
===========

A whidmill joins d amount of copies of a complete graph on k vertices at
exactly one shared vertex.

+--------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : G = windmillGraph(4,5)                                         |
